            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 35:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea niidaw saawa weaghuumeeda jea gwasina giliwas gadiyoojiga sean sin gearnoodiga ea gea ng'oorda geediga, ea gea bareahi iheeni, ea nabita hang'weaka oormeeda gasa gwatuudu, ea gea oomng'i, ea gea areeri, ea gea bumbuni miyaasiin ghana gadiyoojiga sean sin fuga bareahi iheeni ghana gadiyoojiga ghayi miyeesin.",
          "type": "text",
